  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Youth Sounding Board</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Technical Assistance - Youth Sounding Board - The Cooperation Facility, with a budget of EUR&amp;nbsp;2 500 000, will fund the procurement of various Technical Assistance services. The Facility aims to design EU development interventions and related visibility and communication activities. It will ensure design and implementation of activities addressing the need for the development of conflict sensitive and responsive future engagements, intensified strategic communication and public diplomacy activities and stronger coordination with Member States in designing Team Europe Initiatives (TEIs).</narrative>
  </description>
